SUMMARY:AMC Friday Evening Ecstatic Dance w/ DJ Purristess + Star Tribe
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Movement Collective\nFriday\, April 24th\n\nEvening 
 Dance Wave 7:00 pm \\- 9:00 pm \\| Warmup 7pm \\| Opening Circle 7:30pm\nG
 uest DJ Purrristess\nStar Tribe epic sound system & AMC Collaboration!\n\n
 Location: Pack Square\n$20-40 Suggested\, ($20 Minimum. No one turned away
  due to funds)\n\n\\~\\~\\~\n\n\\*\\* Please note that the dance starts at
  Warm up. The doors close promptly at Opening Circle and any that come lat
 e will be turned away. Please be on time to ensure a safe and secure conta
 iner. \\*\\*\n\nTicket Prices: $15 - $30 or name your price.\nNo one turne
 d away for lack of funds!\n\nPre-registration Recommended:\nhttps://ashevi
 llemovementcollective.org/weekly-dance/\n\n\\~\\~\\~\n\nVOLUNTEER!\nWe nee
 d volunteers. Volunteer and dance for free! Register to volunteer at:\nhtt
 ps://ashevillemovementcollective.org/volunteer/\n\nIMPORTANT ANNOUNCEMENTS
 :\nDoor will close at the beginning of the opening circle. Please note: NO
  ENTRY AFTER OPENING CIRCLE BOTH WAVES!\n\nCollective agreements:\nhttps:/
 /ashevillemovementcollective.org/our-dance/\n\nAbout AMC:\nAsheville Movem
 ent Collective envisions a world that moves in harmony where all are free 
 to be their authentic selves within a loving community. Our mission and ai
 m are to inspire authenticity and healthy community through free-form danc
 e by hosting dance waves for personal and community transformation.\n\nAMC
  is a 501(c)(3) nonprofit organization.\n\n\\~\\~\\~\n\nSee you on the dan
 ce floor!"
