SUMMARY:AMC Friday Ecstatic Dance @ WWC w/ DJ Kristikka
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Movement Collective\nFriday\, May 1st\nEvening Dance
  Wave 7:00 pm \\- 9:00 pm \\| Warmup 7pm \\| Opening Circle 7:30pm\nDJ \\|
  Facilitator Kristikka\nIntention: Full Moon Frolic\nSomething magical awa
 its…what wants to unfold within you under this luminous Flower Full Moon
 ? Join us for an evening of outdoor dance at the Warren Wilson College pav
 ilion\, where moonlight and movement weave together in a field of possibil
 ity. Let the glow of the moon guide your journey as we dance beneath the s
 tars\, held by the elements and the rhythms of the wave.\n\nAbout the DJ\n
 DJ Kristikka\, Kris Hostikka loves creating a sacred container that takes 
 you on an inward journey utilizing rhythm to move us from quiet embodiment
  to chaos and down into stillness and integration. She feels that movement
  is medicine\, weaving intention and a rich blend of world beats where it
 ’s possible to be with what is and open to what wants to be seen\, felt 
 and moved. You can find her dance mixes here: [http://soundcloud.com/dj-kr
 istikka](https://soundcloud.com/dj-kristikka?utm_id=97758_v0_s00_e0_tv4&fb
 clid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExU3h6d0laS3JUTEFScnc0NXNydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjA
