SUMMARY:AMC Sunday Ecstatic Dance w/ DJ Esmae
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Movement Collective\nSunday\, May 3rd\n1st Dance Wav
 e 8:30\\-10:30am \\| Warmup 8:30am \\| Opening Circle 9am\n2nd Dance Wave 
 10:30\\-12:30am \\| Warmup 10:30am \\| Opening Circle 11am\nDJ Esmae \\(Fa
 cilitator Pathway\\) \\| Facilitator Micah Swabb\n\nIntention: Dancing wit
 h Love\n\nThis is an invitation to explore love in motion. Maybe it’s ab
 out dancing with yourself or another in a loving way or feeling into how l
 ove would move if it was embodied. Can we be that? Are we already being th
 at without changing anything?\nMegan Belling (DJ Esmæ) (facilitator pathw
 ay)\n\nDJ Esmæ has been moving in the world of ecstatic dance for over 13
  years and sharing musical journeys as a DJ for the past 5. Her sets weave
  sound into pathways of remembrance\, honoring the unfolding of one’s ow
 n becoming. She invites an awakening of expression and emotion that may ha
 ve been resting beneath the surface. Through tension\, rhythm\, and textur
 e\, she holds space for dancers to return to themselves.\nListen to her mi
 xes at: [https://soundcloud.com/djesmae](https://soundcloud.com/djesmae?ut
 m_id=97758_v0_s00_e223_tv4_tp1&fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExMnF4Z01pSW
 V2VTdNY0ZmM3NydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR5796oTzjQTp2A0mqgo-jFG
 ja75upgz7gMf-Th-zy6xBkoXPv6-cmwP5wZGJw_aem_Iir5S_oF19G_5d0S9i46QA)\\~\\~\\
 ~\n\n\\*\\* Please note that the dance starts at Warm up. The doors close 
 promptly at Opening Circle and people who arrive late will be turned away.
  Please be on time to ensure a safe and secure container. \\*\\*\n\nTicket
  Price: $15-30 or name your price.\nNo one turned away for lack of funds!\
 n\n\\~\\~\\~\n\nPre-registration Recommended:\nhttps://ashevillemovementco
 llective.org/event/\n\nVOLUNTEER!\nWe need volunteers. Volunteer and dance
  for free! Register to volunteer at: [https://ashevillemovementcollective.
 org/volunteer/](https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/volunteer/?fbclid=
 IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExVTF6aExURExqbndxM3JFUHNydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3
 ODgyMDA4OTIAAR6puHJaet_dJGFESCItA4rMD5vM_RHt9QzUSALulddRTAtGKexRuWuiBE8tDw
 _aem_vXP_JSWUu1NrAFuKa--PQA)\n\nIMPORTANT ANNOUNCEMENTS:\nDoor will close 
 at the beginning of the opening circle. Please note: NO ENTRY AFTER OPENIN
 G CIRCLE BOTH WAVES!\n\nCollective agreements:\n[https://ashevillemovement
 collective.org/our-dance/](https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/our-dan
 ce/?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExVTF6aExURExqbndxM3JFUHNydGMGYXBwX2lkE
 DIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR5CSyB7238bGlkEsU_Cg_jsh0446YHLe69W1y3KV5-T6oMaN-7
 Z3q32wDznUA_aem_wUhim1G2JnrnWxIQYKCcIA)\n\nAbout AMC:\nAsheville Movement 
 Collective envisions a world that moves in harmony where all are free to b
 e their authentic selves within a loving community. Our mission and aim ar
 e to inspire authenticity and healthy community through free-form dance by
  hosting dance waves for personal and community transformation. AMC is a 5
 01(c)(3) nonprofit organization.\n\nSee you on the dance floor!
